# from:length: counts characters and survives very large numbers
>> s := ['ééééééééééééééé'].
Ijade kọ: (s ṣe-ẹda lati: 0 gigun: 20), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (s ṣe-ẹda lati: 10 gigun: 20), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (s ṣe-ẹda lati: 14 gigun: 1), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (s ṣe-ẹda fo: 20), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: ['-'], ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (['abcdef'] lati: 2 gigun: 2), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (['abc'] lati: 1 gigun: ['9e300'] nọmba), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (['abc'] lati: 1 gigun: ['-9e300'] nọmba), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (['abc'] lati: ['9e300'] nọmba gigun: 1), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: ['-'], ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (['abc'] lati: ['-9e300'] nọmba gigun: 2), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (['abc'] lati: ['nan'] nọmba gigun: 2), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: (['abc'] lati: 0 gigun: ['nan'] nọmba), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: ['-'], ila-tuntun.
